    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dbf6c8ab1c6b112b1112be3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有这样的衣服啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72980ab1493db3e2ce5f14faec482b4affff65ebdd7ccf206e1a5791f305337e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe954c796dead780ed84dfb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时，都想穿着与场合相称的衣装。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e93cab4ddcd31eb368ef4d5f49407c5f15b6a2aa593f51a3eb83c53426ae7e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f10c69e03ff329b64230bf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e4569b3e376977cf7f785a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来进行一场配得上最强的较量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3583b6dbd9e8eba0064debb6ef6ace4359dc6461e650f976324ee70628fc8bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:861407da67958ffb0ba2886a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很强――但是，\r\n赌上家族的骄傲，\r\n我接受挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa6642efb5973dc7cf94ec4177aff2ba4c52643adeb57a2d0261bb65cec160bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1dc7af77e5b494ceb8b35ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨经常做冰沙。\r\n能一次摄取营养……就算\r\n有些不合口味，也能喝下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ced22b9b745973be7827439a1b43083088f6dea6c4662632ad97064939cd998",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4594da0dd36924204294aaa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清晨跑步时，一定能看到\r\n学园里的某个人在努力。……斗志\r\n也与朝阳一同升起。可不能输啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd91c729cd9086aae5aee407a95dac72c95a526a1c8073390d86bf899cc934bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cd0efb0d2056362843ef6ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在自助餐厅，能度过有意义的\r\n时光。刚才也听见有人分享\r\n新款蛋白粉的使用体验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8677bccc0bb58dc77352446048165ca71ac6d9f6c3ae87fc955d52a2530b6e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:660943a71d1d6f7d94393529",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上课时，我会叫醒睡着的同学。\r\n因为困意，错过宝贵的学习机会\r\n实在太可惜了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcddb555d671048cbcc5e4baa67819bc1d3dca25a1c3d632839091bc4179c27e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0208a74c9b8ae939df7b0f2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会仔细做完拉伸\r\n再入睡。特别是，腿部……\r\n为了明天，也能尽情奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "366de4810f1a9f019272b6bc4b16e9372c84bde684eef3ae7477bb87a4a329f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:385e4afa8921e701fb1f72c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了优质睡眠，睡前会\r\n戴耳机听古典音乐。\r\n……偶尔，会忘记关直到天亮……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fe9a80040d6fe68e14ab72b9bddcbe322547041211091193e9dcdc4a93687ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12c283c5b132cd56c5752e5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "选拔赛的季节到了。\r\n今年出众者的传闻我已经听说……\r\n我也，不能输。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aa3237a7c8ee4f42a9d88c519c88aee075c72024ac838531f208c8d067c7c64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07481a0745e58afe7ff26500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不适合奔跑的，这个季节\r\n原本不喜欢……但也是祭典的季节。\r\n小北的话，让我改变了看法",
      "source_fingerprint": "070a80c871dbbfdbb8e316eff3c4bee1cf3cdbc797306d79138103528e73a615",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc30dfdcceccf04f12f4a501",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "通过阅读增长知识，以艺术提升\r\n修养。……积蓄也是重要的\r\n时光。并非只有焦躁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "346a5d63b1975f49ce7fcb0a003e76c51ae9cda5780241038f87305fd9781c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27651263967712c43032add7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天肌肉容易僵硬。今年也去\r\n温泉吧……泡完后打乒乓球\r\n再泡一次，这样重复3组",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a3c271240a2123383a2b3bf87d8c25aa55cb81ffdea756043a42e1eae52394",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45f0c3b00a41b68d966835b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "德古拉好像害怕阳光，\r\n但那样一来早上的训练就……\r\n真能达到最强之境吗，那样……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e454339765552e013b84bc33629f3f0d64760c20e02702dc92b60ad11b7e6b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f4e34652973619c7408ac13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上我常和皇冠一起吃水煮蛋\r\n皇冠有各个国家的调味料，\r\n怎么吃都不会腻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b0db4b672587049caa15c99e27f135ef834a1e593967abb29bf9c7d61f3d5e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b12ae2288b8ad374f17d493",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秘诀在于先温热茶杯。\r\n泡得不错的大吉岭红茶……气槽姐和\r\n爱律前辈，会喜欢吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "d76aa1b8c838546ebbe63af584fa4af046d158564beb9f62f86e7d8e4c69e0e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e59a02ed81dbf52ca6761090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以红色蔬菜为主的果蔬汁，我也经常\r\n会喝……但最近，我在喝的时候\r\n总会有其他孩子被吓一跳……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff7cab5e564dc0c0872aaa6e4ae0f67b96c71211a42aa5a86315ba3c22580280",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e48321ce188089f87f0263d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "健身房的训练，留到最后的\r\n是我和玫瑰。虽然没有\r\n交谈……但总觉得受到了鼓舞呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91dc422cf003425e55bafeab05ce0f5e7fb45cd8f8ecdecdccb5c6da80e2f20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9360f707fa39cf33e118862f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我从图书室借了关于德古拉的\r\n书。到了晚上，那个……\r\n我都在一点一点地读。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7b68533e118b84924330495ee1626405de52385b4a1d1c731ac3e1be34afad0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4faeda9efd44f20989728656",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍的迎新活动要举办运动会\r\n呢。我不会让新生背上心理负担\r\n……所有项目，都由我引向胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "296440d603c130a6bb9386d54052cb87a00937a299c28aca9649e8954086e917",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c97c3db360dcf57f3cc0dfd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在沙滩上和皇冠她们比试了堆沙堡\r\n……沙堡还真是深奥啊。\r\n下次要堆得更巨大……更接近最强……",
      "source_fingerprint": "10f32b75b60c7fc23ae5ca583841fb4d58f011c1a52bd0c6d9d8d6c1d6b68204",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05fb25cfa95192ff056b68c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟光钻说想去法国看看，\r\n她就表示愿意为我做向导。\r\n……我也得提前稍微做点功课才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad02a20d2fea34d7a3711eea78c279fa6f9736cd687da9edd15a3c66bf3fef85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a5be1677d0fed1ce5c25049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "积雪的树木……那是背负着诸多\r\n心意依然傲然挺立的强大象征。\r\n……我也必须像那样，凛然伫立才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "014048489a7757616f1ed5d0b7a9333dab317dee317b6680da057a7be92cc564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f0e6b2ec7a09b048f06ef43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是情人节，啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed53321d143ea8fb24a4d3f7a7377598b151ac46f844792fce69994f666e21d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877e1416a30a449aaf67cd69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是情人节，呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "256af17b09fa41088a27a0adc662595ccb7836286dee381a2a4efce0182e12f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58610aa520442214d2b4cdbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢气槽姐的花坛。\r\n因为她看着植物生长时，\r\n脸上的神情真的很温柔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48957c1843335f804b26d40bb294c0a47bf62adfb76d3c4fcff4cf44446d68e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553a4c4a65ed0bcf446c9683",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏皇冠，英语学习\r\n十分顺利。我想更加努力\r\n做到像她那样，自信地开口。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1dc2b812ae1cff5e3e860e7a34040c0e8e1d92fd036df54d2440f87614fc8d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aca9962d805ab45a1833e5d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "川上从天上掉下来了。\r\n原因完全不明……\r\n幸好，接住了她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "425bb70d706a4f80d53748a3eaad83b53de3039ca655f5148e3e8e5d3b5c6b49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47332d7f12ffdb3c41febbf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火山向我推荐了，一种名叫\r\n蓝靛果的东西。还附上了营养\r\n资料……真是准备周全。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b41ada0dac58cbc13ee3818d1adecea783890283b48921a0fb2f044ea2a11b1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e672fa1beb1816a3a11a9b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就连现在，回过神来\r\n脑海里也浮现出草地赛道。\r\n该如何超越眼前的赛马娘……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebd5df8145ed94927f08e3ca8356f61246581723c987469e86629f9c4ac7aee7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26dab5493eb037db52fe3989",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "粉丝的支持会化为力量……\r\n如今我，切实体会到了这句话。\r\n想将感激融入指尖，舞动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45b45f0ce5bac07663e546ee54fd47d5f85c23e4952e44e22853e45b48baa025",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edd7c731d566df254b10ed8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣装很华美。虽不常穿白色，\r\n但它给人纯净明亮的印象。\r\n……偶尔穿穿，也不坏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95f9f44dc82093e4a362df3a21498dbddfab6333421227b3ad669d2b7f02bd01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:088b841549447c8a0494b775",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肩上的羽毛，寄托着飞翔的心愿――借用了\r\n气槽姐的设计。为了让我也成为\r\n兼具品位和力量的赛马娘，像她一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1e673e29aa429a06568515efe98bd81f2cf1d53d6010c26415b9b744faf5616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f16f7ef1fbd5ee4728b2d5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "靴子的设计，蕴含意义。\r\n力量，以及羁绊――都是我重视的事物",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d19eb6673dd494e2d5f83557b38361a625a9f0daa2b7e4e7fc7e1b614e6adca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91008"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
